# TODO - Linux baseline

## Objective

Verify the minimal workspace on Linux x86-64.

## Acceptance

- Run `cargo validate` successfully and report actual tests and failures.
- Keep the public repository empty until the first commit is authorised.

## Evidence

On 2026-11-24, `cargo validate --no-cache` passed on Linux x86-64 with
rustc 1.100.0. The fresh run executed 6 hook tests and 11 validator tests,
with no test failures. Rustfmt, Clippy, workspace compilation, local crate
packaging, roadmap and language contracts, and MarkdownLint all passed.

The repository has no `.git` directory, and no commits or publishing actions
were performed. Android, browser targets and playable game behaviour were
not tested. This validates the minimal Linux bootstrap, not game parity.
